CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 2 --por --allow-pointer-unsoundness --no-assertions --datarace
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
`ph->n`, with `ph = &th[i].cell` for an undecided i, is lowered to a 4-byte
extract of all of `th` at POINTER_OFFSET(ph). Renaming the extract's operand
recorded a shared read of every leaf of `th` with the path guard alone, so
the reader was paired with main's write of th[0].op, a field it never
reads: a race no execution has. Each leaf is now read under the condition
that the extracted bytes meet it.

Reported FAILED before the fix, SUCCESSFUL after. Reduced from
pthread-complex/elimination_backoff_stack (no-data-race).

See `byte_extract_member_read_race`: main writes th[0].cell.n, the field
read, and that must stay FAILED.
